<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.25.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.25.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.25.0 (2026-11-20): chapter 17 page 9.20.0 built; 410 of 412 page-test features pass; one environment-sensitive check (longest main-thread task after load, 200 ms) still fails, so the page stage stays InProgress. Earlier: see 1.24.0."@en .

ex:Lineage10 backlog:hasAuditNote "Chapter 17 page stage 2026-11-20: page 9.20.0 (deck 3.0.0 manifest, lambda-free A-box 1.0.4 in the form the browser runs, inputs renamed to 9_20_0, drafts 9.32-9.96 removed). Root causes found and fixed: examples were built with the wrong Python (now the browser's Pyodide); the interpreter wrapper treated sys.exit(0) as failure; the first picture example paid about 250 ms for loading all Pillow plugins (now three plugins loaded at start); one example, Decrypt return values, tried five passwords at about 35 ms each (now three; the other two cases stay covered by two other examples). Remaining: the post-load main-thread check measures 222 to 309 ms against 200 ms because each example run takes 120 to 250 ms on this two-core machine; the same examples took the same time in the earlier page here. Not weakened, not waived: page stage not Done, release stage not opened. Owner decision requested."@en .
